    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "WHAT: non-5xx share of kube-apiserver requests over 30d. WHY: the control plane's only performance SLO \u2014 KubeAPIDown covers outages, this covers degradation. DO: below 99.9% \u2192 API Server drilldown; check etcd flips and latency panels.",
